The registry-first sample tests/registry/sk.jsonl contains addresses and coordinates from the
Register adries (address register) of the Ministry of Interior of the Slovak Republic
(Ministerstvo vnútra Slovenskej republiky), dataset "Adresy podľa krajov (csv)", distribution
"Adresy podľa krajov (všetky kraje)", file "Adresy pod_a krajov UTF8_04_2026.csv", downloaded on
2026-10-28. The national open-data catalogue publishes it under CC0 1.0 Universal
(https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/); no attribution is required.
Source: https://data.slovensko.sk/datasety/b27f57f1-7e76-45e0-8968-631f9176b2e9
(https://data.slovensko.sk/download?id=d22c42f3-82b5-450d-b8fb-4245d50a31ec).
Queries were constructed from registry fields. Per-case file checksums and retrieval dates are
recorded in the corpus; docs/evaluation/registry/sk.md records the upstream checksum.
